      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Journal Entry 92\n\nI couldn't help it.. As soon as I saw it I had to buy it. It was her favorite toy. Just looking at it I can still hear her laugh.. I can remember her first steps, her first words... If any of the others saw that I have a stuffed Bantha under my bunk, I don't know what would happen. A mandalorian soldier with a stuffed Bantha? Ha, I'd lose any credability with the others.\n\nEven so, I can't get rid of it. It's like having a piece of her memory with me. Enough writing for now, I need to get back to fixing those speeders. I love you Emma. Daddy will see you again some day.",
